.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ls 1  "ls " 
.SH NAME
ls \- List files in a local folder
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBls\fR [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-local\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-enrich\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List files in a local folder
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Collect and sort output instead of streaming it
.TP
\fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR [default: 0]
Scanner threads (1 disables parallelism, 0 uses all available CPUs)
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR
Show only entries not yet downloaded (State == remote)
.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Scan the local disk instead of the metadata index (works on any path, even outside a Syncweb folder)
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR \fI<PATH_PREFIX>\fR
Only entries whose path starts with this prefix
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR \fI<PATH_GLOB>\fR
Only entries whose path matches this glob pattern
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-enrich\fR
Skip per\-file disk metadata lookup (pure metadata listing)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]

